---
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { LEGAL, CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../../data/site-config';
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../styles/global.css';
import OfficialSources from '../../components/OfficialSources.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Legal notices for this debt payoff calculator 2026"
  description="Publisher details, editorial responsibility, terms of use and the disclaimer applying to every figure this calculator produces, plus how to raise a complaint."
>
  <section class="py-16 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto prose prose-lg">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-text mb-8">Legal Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted mb-8">Last updated: July 2025</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text mt-8 mb-4">Publisher</h2>
      <LegalIdentity mode="publisher" lang="en" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text mt-8 mb-4">Hosting</h2>
      <LegalIdentity mode="hosting" lang="en" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text mt-8 mb-4">Not Financial Advice</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
        The information, tools, and calculators provided on MyDebtPayoff.com are for educational and
        informational purposes only. Nothing on this website constitutes financial advice, tax advice, legal advice,
        or any other professional advice. The content should not be relied upon as a substitute for professional
        financial guidance tailored to your individual circumstances.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text mt-8 mb-4">Calculator Accuracy</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
        Our debt payoff calculator uses standard amortization formulas to estimate payoff timelines and interest
        costs. While we strive for accuracy, actual results may differ due to factors including but not limited to:
        variable interest rates, changes in minimum payment amounts, fees and penalties, payment processing timing,
        and rounding differences. The calculator provides estimates intended for planning purposes only.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text mt-8 mb-4">No Guarantees</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
        MyDebtPayoff.com makes no guarantees, representations, or warranties of any kind, express or implied,
        regarding the accuracy, completeness, reliability, or suitability of the information, calculations, or
        content provided on this website. Any reliance you place on such information is strictly at your own risk.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text mt-8 mb-4">Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
        This website may contain links to third-party websites or resources. These links are provided for
        convenience only. MyDebtPayoff.com has no control over the content, privacy policies, or practices
        of any third-party websites and assumes no responsibility for them.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text mt-8 mb-4">Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
        To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, MyDebtPayoff.com and its operators shall not be
        liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising out of
        or relating to your use of, or inability to use, this website or its content. This includes, without
        limitation, damages for loss of profits, data, or other intangible losses.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text mt-8 mb-4">Changes to This Disclaimer</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
        We reserve the right to update or modify this legal disclaimer at any time without prior notice. Your
        continued use of this website following any changes constitutes your acceptance of the revised disclaimer.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text mt-8 mb-4">Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
        Questions about this disclaimer go to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. If you believe your personal data has been mishandled, you may also complain to {LEGAL.supervisoryAuthority}, whose complaint form is at <a href={LEGAL.supervisoryAuthorityUrl} rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">{LEGAL.supervisoryAuthorityUrl}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <OfficialSources />
</Layout>
